reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:65:  // monotonic — it does NOT wind back at #pop: returned lists escape by ref.
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:66:  // A bare list(VS) Val stays legal (read-only inputs in claims flow unboxed);
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:67:  // only CONSTRUCTORS in program syntax allocate.
