reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:69:  rule isRefV(ref(_:Int)) => true
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:70:  rule isRefV(_:Val)      => false [owise]
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:71:
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:72:  // closure cells (Python-faithful capture): the heap holds cellV(V); a
