reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:76:  syntax Bool ::= isCellRef(Val) [function, total]
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:77:  rule isCellRef(cellRef(_:Int)) => true
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:78:  rule isCellRef(_:Val)          => false [owise]
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:79:  // k-top deref for cell-bound reads surfacing INSIDE the annotated frame
