reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:81:  // DECIDABLY inapplicable in plain frames — an unguarded rule lets the
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:82:  // prover narrow abstract k-top values into cellRef junk (probed on
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:83:  // 26-remove-duplicates). Cross-frame reads (a comprehension closure
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:84:  // reading the enclosing function's cellvar) deref inside #look instead.
