reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:230:    => OP ==String "==" orBool OP ==String "!=" orBool OP ==String "<"
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:231:       orBool OP ==String "<=" orBool OP ==String ">" orBool OP ==String ">="
reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:232:  // the four ordering operators only (< <= > >=)
