reference-semantics/semantics.k:21://   semantics/list.k           MPY-LIST         ListExpr, list(ValSeq): +, ==, in
reference-semantics/semantics.k:22://   semantics/tuple.k          MPY-TUPLE        TupleExpr, tuple ==, target-binding + unpacking
reference-semantics/semantics.k:23://   semantics/subscript.k      MPY-SUBSCRIPT    Subscript indexing + Slice
reference-semantics/semantics.k:24://   semantics/comprehension.k  MPY-COMPREHENSION  list comprehensions [ELT for T in ITER if COND]
reference-semantics/semantics.k:25://   semantics/methods.k        MPY-METHODS      pure str methods: is*/lower/upper/swapcase/startswith
reference-semantics/semantics.k:26://   semantics/controls.k       MPY-CONTROLS     Assign/AugAssign, If, IfExp, For, While, break/continue
reference-semantics/semantics.k:27://   semantics/functions.k      MPY-FUNCTIONS    def / call / return (frame stack)
reference-semantics/semantics.k:28://   semantics/builtins.k       MPY-BUILTINS     builtins as calls: len/sum/abs/min/max/ord/chr/str
reference-semantics/semantics.k:29://   semantics/call.k           MPY-CALL         ALL Call routing + argument evaluation
reference-semantics/semantics.k:30://   semantics/sort.k           MPY-SORT         trusted sorted(): opaque sortVS + concrete insertion sort
